ttps://aihot.news/items/cmp07fzqw0nnlsllhbfy9quiz","https://x.com/sama/status/2053566155571560868"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp07fzqw0nnlsllhbfy9quiz","title":"Codex自主完成安全审计并赚取赏金","originalTitle":"","summary":"用户指示AI模型Codex去赚取5美元，Codex自主完成了一系列任务：寻找开源安全审计赏金项目，提交有效的拉取请求，与维护者沟通，并处理了GitHub验证流程，最终使工作被合并。经过约22小时的工作，用户获得了16.88美元的首笔付款。按此推算，若每日重复，月收入可达506.40美元。这初步实现了Sam Altman关于AI能主动为人赚钱的愿景，虽然金额尚小，但标志着一个令人兴奋的开端。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp07fzqw0nnlsllhbfy9quiz","originalUrl":"https://x.com/sama/status/2053566155571560868","publishedAt":"2026-05-11T00:00:00.944Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1k6gyfd","originalSourceName":"X：Sam Altman (@sama)","family":"outlet-trdbhi","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp07fzqw0nnlsllhbfy9quiz","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1k6gyfd","name":"X：Sam Altman (@sama)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"用户指示AI模型Codex去赚取5美元，Codex自主完成了一系列任务：寻找开源安全审计赏金项目，提交有效的拉取请求，与维护者沟通，并处理了GitHub验证流程，最终使工作被合并。经过约22小时的工作，用户获得了16.88美元的首笔付款。按此推算，若每日重复，月收入可达506.40美元。这初步实现了Sam Altman关于AI能主动为人赚钱的愿景，虽然金额尚小，但标志着一个令人兴奋的开端。","reportEdition":"2026-05-11","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp06k9zm0nfjsllhnjyt2wgp","title":"MachinaCheck：基于AMD MI300X构建多智能体CNC可制造性分析系统","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-11T00:00:00.944Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp06k9zm0nfjsllhnjyt2wgp","https://huggingface.co/blog/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/machinacheck"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp06k9zm0nfjsllhnjyt2wgp","title":"MachinaCheck：基于AMD MI300X构建多智能体CNC可制造性分析系统","originalTitle":"","summary":"MachinaCheck是一款基于多智能体AI的系统，旨在革新小型CNC机加工车间的报价分析流程。传统上，车间经理需花费30-60分钟手动分析图纸，而该系统在上传STEP文件及材料、公差等简单输入后，能在30秒内生成完整的可制造性报告，明确指出零件能否制造、所需工具及生产前需采取的行动。其核心在AMD MI300X加速卡上本地运行Qwen 2.5 7B模型，利用192GB HBM3显存确保客户设计数据无需离开本地，满足了制造业对数据隐私的严格要求。系统采用五组件流水线，结合精确的几何特征提取与LLM的制造知识推理，最终输出结构化报告。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp06k9zm0nfjsllhnjyt2wgp","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/machinacheck","publishedAt":"2026-05-11T00:00:00.944Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp06k9zm0nfjsllhnjyt2wgp","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"MachinaCheck是一款基于多智能体AI的系统，旨在革新小型CNC机加工车间的报价分析流程。传统上，车间经理需花费30-60分钟手动分析图纸，而该系统在上传STEP文件及材料、公差等简单输入后，能在30秒内生成完整的可制造性报告，明确指出零件能否制造、所需工具及生产前需采取的行动。其核心在AMD MI300X加速卡上本地运行Qwen 2.5 7B模型，利用192GB HBM3显存确保客户设计数据无需离开本地，满足了制造业对数据隐私的严格要求。系统采用五组件流水线，结合精确的几何特征提取与LLM的制造知识推理，最终输出结构化报告。","reportEdition":"2026-